<p>When you kill a foe with a melee strike you quickly throw some of their remains in your steam engine, instantly regenerating <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 6, 8, 10, 12</acronym> steam.</p><p>When you deal a critical melee strike you also have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 15%, 21%, 25%, 28%</acronym> chance to cut a part of your foe and use it in your steam engine.</p><p>When either of those happens this strikes fear in all foes in radius 4 of the victim, brainlocking them for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> turns.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">To the meat grinder!</span></span></p>